      "message": "The behavior before https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/apps/CarrierConfig/+/735829/3/assets/carrier_config_310410.xml was already to reset modem when receiving REGULAR_DEACTIVATION on ATT.\n\nIn fact, in today\u0027s implementation, causeCodes will never be null (because carrier config\u0027s default value is an empty int array). So the code added in aosp/737068 is actually the dead code.\n\nI think we probably should do this.\n\nif (this \u003d\u003d REGULAR_DEACTIVATION \u0026\u0026 b.getBoolean(CarrierConfigManager                            .KEY_RESTART_RADIO_ON_PDP_FAIL_REGULAR_DEACTIVATION_BOOL) {\n    return true;\n}\n\nreturn Arrays.stream(causeCodes).anyMatch(i -\u003e i \u003d\u003d getErrorCode());\n\nIn the other hand, we need to check why regular deactivation resets the modem. Or Paris/AOSP are out of sync?",
